How to Get There
After much research, there are two ways to get to the island: ferry or fly. 

Fly: Out of Medan
There is only one route scheduled to Nias from Medan, flying four times a day each way. Prices vary significantly throughout the year. We found flights for roughly $50 Cad per per person, but we often see them for over $100.

